Intelligent Claims Processing & Case Management Agent
Problem Definition Document — apply LangChain, LangGraph and MCP to a real-world, end-to-end business process
Audience	Forward Deployed Engineers (FDEs), UHG account
Prerequisite	Completed training on LangChain, LangGraph and Model Context Protocol (MCP)
Level	L300 (Developer) — multi-agent orchestration, MCP servers, human approvals, evaluation
Suggested duration	4 hours of build time, followed by a demo and panel Q&A
Team format	Individual or small teams, as decided by the facilitator
