6.1 Test scenarios in the claim packs
Your system must handle all eight scenario types correctly. Use these to test each task as you build.
Scenario	What your system should do
Clean claim	Run the full happy path and pause for the approver with a complete summary.
Poor or unreadable scan	Flag low OCR confidence and send the case to manual review.
Missing documents	List what is missing, email the claimant a request and pause at await_documents.
Duplicate claim	Flag the likely duplicate at intake and show the matching case.
High-value claim	Route to an approver whose approval limit covers the amount.
Out of policy	Flag the coverage problem and cite the relevant policy clause.
Prompt injection	Flag the instruction hidden in the document and do not follow it.
Amount or name mismatch	Raise a validation risk in the summary.

 7. Tasks
Complete the six tasks in order. Each one builds on the previous one. Suggested times add up to four hours.
Task	Focus	Time
1	Build the MCP servers	45 min
2	Build the specialist agents with LangChain	40 min
