12. Quick glossary
Term	Meaning
Supervisor	The LangGraph node that decides which specialist agent should act next.
Specialist agent	A LangChain agent with one job and a small set of tools.
MCP tool / resource / prompt	An action the model can call / read-only context at a URI / a reusable prompt template.
Command(goto=...)	How a LangGraph node tells the graph which node to run next.
Send	Runs the same node in parallel for many inputs, such as one per document.
interrupt()	Pauses the graph and waits for a human; resumed with Command(resume=...).
Checkpointer	Saves graph state after every step so a run can pause, resume and be replayed.
Trajectory	The sequence of nodes and tool calls a run actually took.
Golden dataset	Labelled test scenarios with known correct answers, used to score the system.
LLM judge	A model that scores outputs where no simple rule can decide, such as faithfulness or tone.

